+# Todo backend
+
+A dependency-free, in-memory Python todo service.
+
+## Run the tests
+
+```sh
+python -m pytest
+```
+
+## Use from Python
+
+```python
+from app.todos import add_todo, complete_todo
+
+todo_id = add_todo("Submit assignment")
+complete_todo(todo_id)
+```
+
+## Requirement status
+
+The supplied specification contains a conflict: REQ-001 requests multi-user
+authentication, while the mandatory constraint says, "Do not add multi-user
+auth." Authentication has not been implemented so the explicit constraint is
+honoured. Consequently, REQ-001 cannot be marked accepted until the
+specification is clarified. The existing todo application is implemented and
+covered by tests, but it is not evidence for REQ-001.
